@ChatApp.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5273

### Регистрация нового пользователя
POST {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userName": "alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "SuperSecret123"
}

###

### Логин — обрати внимание, это POST, а не GET
POST {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userNameOrEmail": "alice",
  "password": "SuperSecret123"
}

###

### Обновление токенов — refreshToken взять из ответа на register/login выше
POST {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "QuhjiPT7j70zGdaw2NNRTKtmKLtf7Zhw+8rA6WZHMoI="
}

###

### Logout — требует Authorization header с access-токеном (эндпоинт помечен [Authorize])
POST {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..5mhN8QU5w3x2Ce4BBnITybw9D3X0njzZnFJbYLNvWo0

{
  "refreshToken": "zZhFnK2gxFx5hLY3IWLrMBOZTk14azOF2KBMwk5JwSA="
}

###
